BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Asheville Introverts
UID:event_315117586@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260714T071204Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260802T161500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260802T180000
SUMMARY:Fantasy and Sci-Fi Silent Book Club
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Introverts\nBOYB - Bring Your Own Book and rant or r
 ave about your current Fantasy or Sci-fi titles at Day Trip! We will likel
 y be in the large ‘back room’ (with the Disco Ball and under the large
  white cat)\n\n**What is a Silent Book Club?**\nReferred to as "Introvert'
 s Happy Hour"\, Silent Book clubs allow readers to engage with each other 
 without the commitment of reading a shared title. Community members gather
  in the same place\, have some casual chit chat\, and then read silently t
 ogether. **This group will focus on Fantasy and Sci-Fi titles (subgenres &
  related genres are welcome!)**\n\n**How does it work?**\nFor the first 15
 -30 mins we will gather\, grab drinks and engage in introductions. Feel fr
 ee to discuss your recent favorites\, mention a title that lives in your h
 ead rent free\, or ask for recommendations! The best part of the Silent Bo
 ok Club is being able to talk shop with other readers!\n\nOnce settled in 
 we will dedicate 45 minutes to silent reading. Your book can be traditiona
 l\, ebook\, or audiobook. Read at your own pace!\n\nAfterwards we will go 
 around show-and-tell style and share what we read with the group. We want 
 to know what you're reading! Organic dialogue welcome!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-introverts/events/315117586
 /
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260605T135147Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260605T135147Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
